{"id":1062,"date":"2026-04-08T10:46:29","date_gmt":"2026-04-08T08:46:29","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/?p=1062"},"modified":"2026-04-15T11:27:13","modified_gmt":"2026-04-15T09:27:13","slug":"accepted-papers-at-ipmu2026-conference","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/2026\/04\/08\/accepted-papers-at-ipmu2026-conference\/","title":{"rendered":"Accepted papers at IPMU&#8217;2026 Conference"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">The <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sbai.uniroma1.it\/conferenze\/ipmu2026\/index.php\">21st International Conference on Information Processing and Management of Uncertainty in Knowledge-Based Systems<\/a> (IPMU&#8217;2026 Conference) will be held in Rome (Italy) in 15-19 June, 2026.<\/mark><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">We have submitted eight papers, all of which have been accepted for presentation:<\/mark><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><em>Two-sample goodness-of-fit tests to a location-scale family using OWA-based skewness coefficients<\/em>, by Marina Iturrate-Bobes, Ignacio Montes and Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><em>Asymptotic confidence intervals for a skewness parameter by using OWA functions<\/em>, by Marina Iturrate-Bobes, Ignacio Montes and Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><em>Weighted Total Variation distances for contextual robustification<\/em>, by David Nieto-Barba, Enrique Miranda and Sebasti\u00e9n Destercke.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><em>An order-theoretic study of the credal sets generated by comparative probabilities<\/em>, by Dar\u00edo Tagarro, Enrique Miranda and Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><em>On the commutativity of the aggregation of capacities and the natural extension to gambles<\/em>, by Ignacio Montes and Enrique Miranda.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><em>Decision making with generalised distortion models<\/em>, by Nicol\u00e1s Carrizosa, Ignacio Montes and Enrique Miranda.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><em>On the specific commutativity with Bayesian conditioning of systematic aggregation rules for probability measures<\/em>, by David Nieto-Barba and Sebasti\u00e9n Destercke.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><em>Construction methods for uninorms on a specific family of bounded lattices<\/em>, by \u00c1nder Go\u00f1i, Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez and Marisol G\u00f3mez.<\/mark><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Moreover, we are organising two special sessions: <em>Aggregation Theory in Non-Traditional Contexts<\/em> (by Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez and Bernard de Baets) and <em>Theoretical and Applied Aspects of Imprecise Probabilities<\/em> (by David Nieto-Barba and Ignacio Montes). Last but not least, Nicol\u00e1s Carrizosa has received an <a href=\"https:\/\/eusflat.org\/eusflat-students-grant-program\/\">EUSFLAT grant<\/a> to attend the conference.<\/mark><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Looking forward to seeing you in Rome!<\/mark><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The 21st International Conference on Information Processing and Management of Uncertainty in Knowledge-Based Systems (IPMU&#8217;2026 Conference) will be held in Rome (Italy) in 15-19 June, 2026. We have submitted eight papers, all of which have been accepted for presentation: Moreover, we are organising two special sessions: Aggregation Theory in Non-Traditional Contexts (by Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez and&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":963,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1062","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-sin-categoria"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1062","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1062"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1062\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1072,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1062\/revisions\/1072"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/963"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1062"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1062"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1062"}